all/story/_/id/50606746/top-de-recruit-dj-jacobs-commits-miami-hours-decommitting-ohio-state","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Eli Lederman","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"D.J. Jacobs decommits from Ohio State, sources say, making top DE available again","description":"D.J. Jacobs, the No. 2 overall recruit in the 2027 class, has decommitted from Ohio State, sources told ESPN, with Tennessee, Georgia and Miami among the leading contenders for the five-star defensive end.","published":"2026-11-26T21:21:16.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50606035/sources-de-dj-jacobs-decommits-ohio-state","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Eli Lederman","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Friday Night Lights,' 'Ted Lasso' top poll ranking 21st-century sports shows","description":"A Seton Hall poll crowns America's favorite modern fictional sports TV series.﻿","published":"2026-11-26T16:01:10.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/story/_/id/50576889/top-fictional-sports-series-21st-century","type":"Story","byline":"Brianna Williams","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"The oldest grudge in football","description":"When Texas Tech and its brash benefactor bought their way into the college football big time, they were settling an old West Texas score.","published":"2026-11-26T13:12:44.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50427039/texas-tech-puf-cody-campbell","type":"Story","byline":"Dave Wilson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Take a 360-degree look at college football's iconic rivalry trophies","description":"Whether ancient, animal or absurd, college football's rivalry trophies take many shapes.","published":"2026-11-26T13:09:54.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/feature/story/_/id/50371090/college-football-rivalry-trophies","type":"Eticket","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"USC band won't perform at UCLA football game after members vandalized campus","description":"The USC Trojan Marching Band will not perform during Saturday's rivalry game against UCLA after members of the band vandalized a portion of UCLA's campus.","published":"2026-11-26T14:39:43.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50600615/usc-band-perform-members-vandalized-ucla-campus","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Paolo Uggetti","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Kent State TD overturned by replay was incorrect decision, MAC says","description":"A Kent State touchdown catch should not have been overturned by replay to incomplete at the end of Tuesday's 17-12 loss to Eastern Michigan, the Mid-American Conference said Wednesday.","published":"2026-11-25T23:05:40.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50597875/kent-state-td-overturned-replay-was-incorrect-mac-says","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"2027 College Football Playoff National Championship odds","description":"Odds and futures to win the 2027 College Football Playoff National Championship.","published":"2026-11-25T19:44:57.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/betting/story/_/id/47664633/2027-college-football-playoff-national-championship-odds-futures","type":"Story","byline":"Doug Greenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Chris Creighton out as coach at Eastern Michigan after 13 seasons","description":"Chris Creighton is out as head coach at Eastern Michigan after 13 seasons with the school.","published":"2026-11-25T19:05:05.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50595706/creighton-coach-eastern-michigan-13-seasons","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Judge denies SEC's request for TRO against LSU in Dec. 3 vote","description":"A federal judge denied the SEC's request for a temporary restraining order to keep LSU from interfering with a Dec. 3 vote of presidents and chancellors on whether to remove the school from the conference.","published":"2026-11-25T20:02:54.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-sports/story/_/id/50595702/judge-denies-sec-request-tro-lsu-dec-3-vote","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Alex Scarborough","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5077638/bray-hubbard","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bray_Hubbard"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Bray Hubbard","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bray_Hubbard","description":"American football player","touched":"2026-11-22T04:17:43Z","intro":"Brayson \"Bray\" Hubbard (born February 14, 2005) is an American college football safety for the Alabama Crimson Tide.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Hubbard was born in Ocean Springs, Mississippi and attended Ocean Springs High School. He was rated as a three-star recruit and committed to play college football for the Alabama Crimson Tide over offers from FAU, Mississippi State, Navy, Tulane, and Southern Miss."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"As a freshman in 2023, Hubbard appeared in nine games for Alabama, notching one tackle. In week 8 of the 2024 season, he notched nine tackles in a 24–17 loss to Tennessee, after replacing injured starter Keon Sabb. Heading into week 9, Hubbard was named the team's starting safety due to Sabb's injury. In his first career start, he totaled seven tackles and an interception in a win over Missouri. Hubbard went viral for jogging during a play that resulted in a touchdown versus Florida State in 2025."}]}}